00:18.260 --> 00:20.470
His confidence is waning by the day.

00:20.470 --> 00:23.800
All the energy he had on 
the first day has evaporated, too.

00:24.160 --> 00:28.030
Fighting against the pros 
is overwhelming him.

00:28.030 --> 00:32.030
When he feels intimidated, he stiffens up 
and isn't able to unleash his full strength.

00:32.740 --> 00:34.280
<i>Nationals will be a stern test.</i>

00:34.650 --> 00:38.920
<i>I need to come up with a way
 to make him feel confident</i>

00:38.920 --> 00:40.840
<i>in the ring and in his everyday life.</i>

00:44.370 --> 00:45.310
Captain!

00:46.190 --> 00:48.730
I'm gonna take you somewhere after training.

00:51.040 --> 00:52.610
Okay!

00:52.610 --> 00:55.350
Tsuruko, did you look into
what I asked you to?

00:55.350 --> 00:56.320
My name is Chizuko.

00:56.510 --> 00:57.840
Hey, Kunisaki...

00:57.840 --> 01:00.450
Where are we going with Hori-san in tow?

01:04.370 --> 01:06.090
H-Hori-san?!

01:06.090 --> 01:08.480
Here's yours, Captain.

01:08.480 --> 01:10.120
You wanna be confident, right?

01:10.120 --> 01:12.470
Well, I know a surefire way.

01:14.170 --> 01:16.600
I was gonna go down there by myself,

01:16.600 --> 01:19.780
but if we can build up your confidence 
and do scouting at the same time...

01:19.780 --> 01:22.010
It kills two birds with one rock!

01:22.230 --> 01:23.950
Two birds with one stone, you mean.

01:23.950 --> 01:25.480
Scouting?

01:25.480 --> 01:27.230
D-Don't tell me...

01:27.230 --> 01:29.100
<b>Welcome</b>

01:27.230 --> 01:29.100
<b>Kanazawa Kita
 High School</b>

01:27.230 --> 01:29.100
<b>Sumo Club</b>

01:28.620 --> 01:30.980
Hey, listen up, punks.

01:30.980 --> 01:33.650
We're here to beat the crap outta you!

